      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-45152",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/77/77775edfdd41e10f1e9a7efaa1e73bdc6778a52afeba43effd3eec4888217750.png)\n\nThe graph above shows the profits of Company $A$ and Company $B$ depending on the number of newspaper adverts they publish in a certain week. Approximately how many adverts should Company $A$ and Company $B$ publish per week to make the same profit?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
